                        sourceRHS.getSourceType().describe() ),
                    sourceRHS.getSourceType(),
                    targetElementType,
                    ""
                );
            }
        }
        else {
            ctx.getMessager().note( 2, Message.ITERABLEMAPPING_SELECT_ELEMENT_NOTE, assignment );
